# measured: 1.82x on four threads at 1.08x the CPU, byte-identical output.
# Kept so the measurement can be reproduced; it is not in HEAD. Apply with
# `git apply benchmarks/render-threads.patch` against the tree the results file
# names. The thread count is read from `LITEDOC4_RENDER_THREADS`, defaulting to
# 1, so an unset environment is today's `for` loop.

